<title>POLAND: POLIGRAFIA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 300,000.</title>
<headline>POLIGRAFIA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 300,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.30 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.46 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.44 vs   0.48</p>
<p> Sales		    3.28 vs   3.05</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.05 vs   0.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.77 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.65 vs   1.61</p>
<p> Sales		   12.25 vs  11.50</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish printing house is Poligrafia SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
